[00:00.00]Whoa! Help! It's wobbly!|哇！救命！它晃来晃去！
[00:05.42]Let me teach you.|我来教你。
[00:08.70]Yeah! Teach me to ride!|好！教我骑车！
[00:11.86]Keep your balance. Pedal slowly.|保持平衡，慢慢踩。
[00:15.40]Pedal slowly. I can do it.|慢慢踩。我可以的。
[00:20.28]Look! It's not wobbly now.|你看！现在不晃了。
[00:23.60]Oh no! How to stop?|哎呀！怎么停下来？
[00:26.32]Break gently next time, sweetie.|下次轻轻刹车，宝贝。
[00:32.20]Break! I know how to break.|刹车！我知道怎么刹车。
[00:35.62]Am I doing great, Grandma?|我做得好吗，奶奶？
[00:40.04]Wow! I'm riding alone!|哇！我自己骑起来了！
[00:42.98]Yes! You did a great job!|太棒了！你做得非常好！
[00:46.92]Hello, little chickens!|你们好呀，小鸡们！
[00:51.58]Oops! Two hands on handlebars.|哎呀！两只手都要扶着车把。
[00:54.62]Hold tight! Be careful!|扶稳了！小心！
[00:57.62]Wind feels so nice.|风吹着真舒服。
[01:01.12]I love riding bikes.|我喜欢骑自行车。
[01:05.62]I ride really well now.|我现在骑得可好了。
[01:08.32]I'm so proud of you.|我真为你骄傲。
[01:13.12]Thank you, Grandma.|谢谢你，奶奶。
[01:15.62]I love you too.|我也爱你。
